<h2>Loupe 1.0.10</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Clearer updates after reinstalling.</strong> If a new copy of Loupe is installed over the one that's running, Check for Updates now offers to reopen Loupe instead of failing with “An error occurred while launching the installer.” Automatic update checks wait until Loupe has been reopened.</li>
</ul>
